```

```text
E   AssertionError: assert 7 == 2
```

Statement: "The test is right; the API leaks other customers'' orders, so the bug has to be fixed in the API, not in the test."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'False. `GET /orders` without a filter is the staging list of all orders (the test runs with an admin token), and the other workers are creating orders at the same moment. The test counted data it does not own. Filter by this test''s customer (`/orders?customer_id=...`) or compare ids, and the count is 2 whatever runs next to it. A permission bug would show up for a customer token, which a separate test should check.', 3, 5
